{%- comment -%}
  The Custom & Business page hero. Brief §9.1.

  An espresso band with the aurora over it, the page's h1, one line of what the
  service is, and one button into the quote form.

  NO LABELLED PLACEHOLDER WHEN THERE IS NO PHOTOGRAPH, and that is a deliberate
  exception to this theme's placeholder rule. The rule exists so a missing asset
  does not collapse a layout that depends on it; here the layout does not depend
  on one. An espresso ground with the aurora and the type set over it is a
  finished surface — it is what the footer is — so an empty photo slot has a
  design rather than a hole, and drawing a grey rectangle labelled "photo" over
  the top would be scaffolding standing in front of something already finished.
  Set the photograph and it fills the band behind a scrim; leave it and the band
  is the artwork. Both states are final.

  THE SCRIM IS NOT OPTIONAL when a photograph is set. `text-ink-invert` on an
  unknown photograph is a contrast bet, and the one thing this theme will not do
  is let colour carry meaning it cannot guarantee — a light shot would put cream
  type on cream. `bg-invert/72` is the same weight the category mosaic uses over
  its tiles for the same reason.

  The aurora's `tone` is `invert` because the band is `bg-invert`; the veil layer
  has to be painted in the colour of the surface underneath or it draws a visible
  rectangle. `relative isolate overflow-hidden` on the band is what keeps
  `soft-light` blending against the band and not the page.

  NO [data-reveal] ANYWHERE IN THIS SECTION. It is the top of the page, so there
  is nothing to scroll to — and `[data-reveal]` ships at `opacity: 0` with
  theme.js deferred, which on a slow phone would leave the h1 invisible from
  first paint until the script parses. hero-carousel.liquid carries the same note
  for the same reason.
{%- endcomment -%}

<section class="relative isolate overflow-hidden bg-invert text-ink-invert">
  {%- if section.settings.image -%}
    <div class="absolute inset-0">
      {% render 'media',
        image: section.settings.image,
        fill: true,
        sizes: '100vw',
        priority: true,
        label: 'Custom apparel photo',
        class: 'rounded-none' %}
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-invert/72"></div>
    </div>
  {%- else -%}
    {% render 'aurora', tone: 'invert', origin: 'top-right' %}
  {%- endif -%}

  <div class="relative z-10 mx-auto w-full max-w-content px-gutter py-section lg:py-block-lg">
    <div class="flex max-w-190 flex-col gap-6">
      <span class="text-micro uppercase tracking-eyebrow text-ink-invert-muted">
        {% render 'copy', value: section.settings.eyebrow, label: 'eyebrow', inline: true %}
      </span>

      <h1 class="text-display leading-display tracking-display">
        {% render 'copy', value: section.settings.heading, label: 'heading', lines: 2 %}
      </h1>

      <p class="wl-measure text-body leading-body text-ink-invert-muted">
        {% render 'copy', value: section.settings.body, label: 'body', lines: 2 %}
      </p>

      {%- if section.settings.cta != blank -%}
        <div class="mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          {% render 'button',
            label: section.settings.cta,
            href: section.settings.href,
            variant: 'invert',
            class: 'max-sm:w-full px-6 sm:px-11' %}

          {%- if section.settings.cta_2 != blank -%}
            {% render 'button',
              label: section.settings.cta_2,
              href: section.settings.href_2,
              variant: 'invert-outline',
              class: 'max-sm:w-full px-6 sm:px-11' %}
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Custom hero",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "paragraph", "content": "Leave the photograph empty and the espresso band with its aurora is the artwork — this is the one hero on the site that does not draw a placeholder, because it does not need a photograph to be finished." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Wear Label Custom" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "heading", "label": "Headline", "default": "Custom Apparel for Your Team & Brand" },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "body", "label": "Body", "default": "Uniforms, merchandise, and apparel tailored to your organization." },
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Photograph" },
    { "type": "header", "content": "Buttons" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta", "label": "Primary label", "default": "Request a quote" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "href", "label": "Primary link" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "cta_2", "label": "Secondary label" },
    { "type": "url", "id": "href_2", "label": "Secondary link" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Custom hero" }]
}
{% endschema %}
